Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,《粉色的研究》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}WATSON!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.95,0:01:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,(约翰·华生医生的博客)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.97,0:01:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,博客写的如何?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your blog going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.53,0:01:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 顺利 很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, good, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你一个字都没写 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't written a word, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚写下了"仍然不信任人"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just wrote "still has trust issues".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,而你颠倒着读出了我写的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you read my writing upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.18,0:01:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我什么意思了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 你是个军人\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, you're a soldier
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.83,0:01:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,从这个身份到普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's going to take you a while
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.70,0:01:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,需要一个过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}to adjust to civilian life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,把你每天的遭遇写在博客上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and writing a blog about everything that happens to you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,会有很大帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}will honestly help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本没有任何遭遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing happens to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,《神探夏洛克》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.03,0:02:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,(10月12日)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你说一辆破车都没了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean there's no ruddy car?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他去滑铁卢了 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went to Waterloo, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 叫辆出租车       - 我从不叫车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get a cab. - I never get cabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我爱你      - 什么时候?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you. - When?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.43,0:02:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快叫辆出租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是个努力生活的乐观男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}was a happy man who lived life to the full.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.54,0:03:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他热爱家庭和工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loved his family and his work,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他选择这样结束自己的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that he should have taken his own life in this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,让人无法理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a mystery
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,也让认识他的人 都感到震惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a shock to all who knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.69,0:03:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,出租车 出租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi, taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.38,0:03:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,11月26日\N{\fnArial\fs30}November 26th
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.22,0:03:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我两分钟 朋友      - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be just two minutes, mate. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回去拿伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just going home to get my umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:03:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以和我一起撑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can share mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.06,0:03:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就两分钟 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two minutes, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,(18岁男孩在体育馆自杀)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.55,0:04:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,11月27日\N{\fnArial\fs30}January 27th
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她还在跳舞?\N{\fnArial\fs30}She still dancing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 如果叫做跳舞的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, if you can call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,拿走她车钥匙了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get the car keys off her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,从她包里拿出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got them out of her bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.81,0:04:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她到哪里去了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,副运输部长贝斯·戴文特的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The body of Beth Davenport, Junior Minister for Transport,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.97,0:05:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天深夜在伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}was found late last night
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.14,0:05:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一建筑工地被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a building site in Greater London.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,初步调查的结果为自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preliminary investigations suggest that this was suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can confirm that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这起自杀案十分类似于\N{\fnArial\fs30}this apparent suicide closely resembles those of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.25,0:05:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,杰弗瑞·帕特森爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Jeffrey Patterson
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.69,0:05:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,和詹姆士·费力默的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}and James Phillimore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.55,0:05:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the light of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们认为他们很有可能有关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}these incidents are now being treated as linked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.74,0:05:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,调查还在继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}The investigation is ongoing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不过雷斯垂德探长会回答大家的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Detective Inspector Lestrade will take questions now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,探长 自杀事件怎么会有关联?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Inspector, how can suicides be linked?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.55,0:05:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们服用的药都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they all took the same poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体都在他们不该出现的地方出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were all found in places they had no reason to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,都没有明显的动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of them had shown any prior indication.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能会有连环自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't have serial suicides.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,显然已经有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, apparently you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这三人之间没有关系吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}These three people, there's nothing that links them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.37,0:05:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时还没发现关系 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no link we've found yet but
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在寻找 一定存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're looking for it. There has to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.34,0:05:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,(错!错!错!)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们都收到了短信 请忽略它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you've all got texts, please ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,上面只写着"错"\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just says "Wrong".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 别管它 如果没有其它问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just ignore that. If there are no more questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:05:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,要问雷斯垂德探长的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Detective Inspector Lestrade
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这次发布会就到此结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to bring this session to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.75,0:06:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,既然是自杀 你们在调查什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're suicides, what are you investigating?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我说的 这几起自杀明显存在联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I say, these suicides are clearly linked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事很不寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an unusual situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.82,0:06:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经派遣最好的人手调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've got our best people investigating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,又收到了“错”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says "Wrong" again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.59,0:06:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能是谋杀吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any chance that these are murders?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是的话 会是连环杀手干的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they are, is this the work of a serial killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.54,0:06:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们更喜欢写这种故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that you like writing about these
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.25,0:06:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但现场状况确系自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}but these do appear to be suicides.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,两者的差别明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,很清楚 毒药是他们自己服下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The poison was clearly self-administered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.45,0:06:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 可如果他们真是被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but if they are murders,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.23,0:06:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大家怎么才能保证自身安全?\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do people keep themselves safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.98,0:06:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,珍爱生命 不要自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,每日邮报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daily Mail
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,现在虽是恐慌时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, This is a frightening time for people
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.49,0:06:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,大家需要的是提高警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}but all anyone has to do is exercise reasonable precautions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,安全是可以由自己创造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are all as safe as we want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,(错!错!错!)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(你知道我在哪里  —夏·福)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你得阻止这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to stop him doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.65,0:07:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,弄的我们像白痴一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's making us look like idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.62,0:07:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我他是怎么做到的 我就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can tell me how he does it, I'll stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.06,0:07:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.51,0:07:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Watson
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克·斯坦佛 巴兹医学院的同学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stamford, Mike Stamford. We were at Barts together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 抱歉 麦克 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sorry, yes, Mike, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.61,0:07:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是 我知道自己胖了      - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I know, I got fat. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.41,0:07:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说你出国了 还中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you were abroad somewhere getting shot at.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.19,0:07:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就是中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在巴兹吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still at Barts then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,现在教书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teaching now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,聪明的年轻人 就像当年的我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, bright young things like we used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝啊 我烦死他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.95,0:07:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.47,0:07:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,恢复之前一直这样呆着?\N{\fnArial\fs30}just staying in town till you get yourself sorted?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.58,0:07:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只靠军队抚恤金 在伦敦无法生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't afford London on an Army pension.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:07:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在别的地方 你活不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't bear to be anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我认识的约翰·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the John Watson I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.67,0:08:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是那个约翰·华生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the John Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哈利没帮你?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't Harry help?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得可能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like that's going to happen
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 找个人一起租房子什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, get a flatshare or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.14,0:08:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谁愿意同我做室友?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd want me for a flatmate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.37,0:08:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你是今天第二个对我说这话的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the second person to say that to me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是第一个?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was the first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有多新鲜?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How fresh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,刚来的 67岁 自然死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in. 67, natural causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.65,0:08:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经在这里工作 我认识他 人不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to work here. I knew him, he was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们从马鞭开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll start with the riding crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.18,0:08:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 今天心情不好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, bad day was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要知道它在20分钟内的伤痕情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know what bruises form in the next 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.59,0:08:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人的不在场证明就靠他了 发短信给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man's alibi depends on it. Text me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.49,0:09:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 我想...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I was wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,等会儿 如果你结束了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe later, when you're finished...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.27,0:09:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你搽了口红\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wearing lipstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.98,0:09:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来不用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't wearing lipstick before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我想显得精神点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I refreshed it a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你刚刚说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, you were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我说 要不要去喝咖啡?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering if you'd like to have coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,黑咖啡 两块糖 谢谢 拿到楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black, two sugars, please. I'll be upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 物是人非了      - 你没想到吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bit different from my day. - You've no idea
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克 可以借电话一用吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, can I borrow your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我的在这儿没信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no signal on mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,座机坏了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's wrong with the landline?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我比较喜欢发短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer to text.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 在我外套里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, it's in my coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这里 用我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, use mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的老朋友 约翰·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an old friend of mine, John Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.15,0:09:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在阿富汗还是伊拉克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afghanistan or Iraq?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.02,0:10:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个国家 阿富汗还是伊拉克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which was it, in Afghanistan or Iraq?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,阿富汗 抱歉 你怎么知道?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afghanistan, sorry, how did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,茉莉 咖啡来了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah Coffee, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.33,0:10:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,口红呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the lipstick?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.09,0:10:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,它对我没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't working for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗? 我觉得很有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? It was a big improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.65,0:10:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在嘴太小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mouth's too small now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你对小提琴感觉如何?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel about the violin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想事情时会拉小提琴 有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I play the violin when I'm thinking and sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,一天都不讲话 你介意吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't talk for days on end. Would that bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,做室友应该知道对方的缺点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Potential flatmates should know the worst about each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.06,0:10:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我的事告诉他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told him about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,一个字都没提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那谁告诉你室友这回事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said anything about flatmates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.60,0:10:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我本人 今早我告诉麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did. Told Mike this morning
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.81,0:10:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我这种人找个室友多困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I must be a difficult man to find a flatmate for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.78,0:10:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,刚过午饭 他就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now here he is just after lunch
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.21,0:10:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,带来一个老朋友 显然刚在\N{\fnArial\fs30}with an old friend clearly just home from
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.63,0:10:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,阿富汗军队服役过 并不难猜到吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}military service in Afghanistan. Wasn't a difficult leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.41,0:10:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道阿富汗的事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know about Afghanistan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.99,0:10:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到了伦敦市中心的一个好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got my eye on a nice little place in central London.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.17,0:10:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,价格我们一起能负担得起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ought to be able to afford it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:10:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,明晚7点整 在那里碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll meet there tomorrow evening, seven o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我真健忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, got to dash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,把鞭子留在停尸间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I left my riding crop in the mortuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.17,0:11:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这表示?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.81,0:11:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,表示什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.21,0:11:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们才刚见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've only just met
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就要一起找房子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're going to go and look at a flat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.81,0:11:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有问题吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.33,0:11:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们彼此一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know a thing about each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道约在哪里见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where we're meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至也不知道你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是军医 刚从阿富汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're an Army doctor and you've been
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.03,0:11:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,被遣送回国\N{\fnArial\fs30}invalided home from Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你有一个哥哥 很关心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a brother worried about you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你却不愿意得到他的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you won't go to him for help because you don't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你对他不满 也许因为他嗜酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}approve of him, possibly because he's an alcoholic,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.90,0:11:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,更有可能是他刚抛弃了他老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}more likely because he recently walked out on his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我也知道医生认为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know that your therapist thinks your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,患有伤残心理后遗症 恐怕这诊断很对\N{\fnArial\fs30}limp's psychosomatic, quite correctly, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,作为室友 这些够了吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough to be going on with, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.10,0:11:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字叫夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name's Sherlock Holmes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.13,0:11:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那里的地址是贝克街221B\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the address is 221B Baker Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,下午好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.53,0:11:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 他一直都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's always like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.89,0:12:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(短信)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,(发送成功)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,(如果哥哥有绿色梯子就逮捕他  —夏·福)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,(搜索)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,(夏洛克·福尔摩斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,(贝克街 威斯敏斯特)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.90,0:12:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.98,0:13:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 福尔摩斯先生      - 请叫我夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah, Mr Holmes. - Sherlock, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.97,0:13:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这里位置很好 应该非常贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is a prime spot. Must be expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.31,0:13:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,房东赫德森太太给了我特价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson, the landlady, she's given me a special deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,欠我一个人情 几年之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owes me a favour. A few years back,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.31,0:13:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,她丈夫在弗罗里达被判处无期徒刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}her husband got himself sentenced to death in Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我出了点力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was able to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.23,0:13:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你让她丈夫免于死刑?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry... you stopped her husband being executed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.19,0:13:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我指证了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I ensured it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.34,0:13:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,赫德森太太 约翰·华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson, Dr John Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.37,0:13:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢       - 请进吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Shall we...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.88,0:13:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这里还挺不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this could be very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.59,0:13:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,确实很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nice indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.87,0:14:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.35,0:14:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我也这样觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I think so, my thoughts precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.22,0:14:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就直接搬进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I went straight ahead and moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,只要把这些垃圾清理出去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as we get all this rubbish cleaned out...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以这都是...      - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So this is all... - Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.53,0:14:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以把它们放放好\N{\fnArial\fs30}obviously I can erm... straighten things up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.38,0:14:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是个骷髅      - 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a skull. - Friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的朋友是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I say friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.74,0:14:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得如何 华生医生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, then, Dr Watson?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,楼上还有一个卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another bedroom upstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们需要两间卧室的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you'll be needing two bedrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.87,0:14:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,当然需要两间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we'll be needing two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.80,0:14:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心的 这里什么人都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't worry, there's all sorts round here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.80,0:14:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,隔壁特勒太太家那对还结婚了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Turner next door's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.28,0:14:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克 看看弄的多乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh... Sherlock The mess you've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.17,0:14:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚在网上搜索了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked you up on the internet last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么有趣的发现吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了你的网站 "演绎法研究"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found your website. The Science of Deduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.77,0:14:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得如何?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.66,0:15:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你说可以从领带看出一个软件设计师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you could identify a software designer by his tie
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.96,0:15:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,从大拇指看出一个飞行员\N{\fnArial\fs30}and an airline pilot by his left thumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我从你的脸和腿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can read your military career
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.11,0:15:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,看出你军人的经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your face and your leg,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,从你的手机上看出你兄弟酗酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your brother's drinking habits on your mobile phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.91,0:15:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么看?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这些自杀是怎么回事 夏洛克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about these suicides then, Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你会感兴趣吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that'd be right up your street.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,3起一模一样的案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.09,0:15:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,4起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.64,0:15:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,第4起发生了 而且这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been a fourth. And there's something
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有些不一样      - 第4起?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- different this time. - A fourth?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克斯顿 劳里斯顿花园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brixton, Lauriston Gardens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这次有什么不同?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's new about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.92,0:15:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要不你也不会专程来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't have come to me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.97,0:15:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有些反常之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}otherwise there was somethin different.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,之前受害人从不留信息 这次有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how they never leave notes? Yeah. This one did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.59,0:15:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你来吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.98,0:15:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这次谁负责取证?      - 安德森\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's on forensics? - Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.88,0:15:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我和他相处不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't work well with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.19,0:15:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,反正他不会是你助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he won't be your assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.46,0:15:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要一个助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I NEED an assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你来吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.12,0:15:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不坐警车 我要跟在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in a police car, I'll be right behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.20,0:16:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,4起连环自杀 这次还有遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four serial suicides, and now a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.41,0:16:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,圣诞节到了啊 赫德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's Christmas. Mrs Hudson,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.56,0:16:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我会迟点来 可能需要准备点食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be late. Might need some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.64,0:16:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的房东 亲爱的 不是管家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your landlady, dear, not your housekeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,冷的也行 约翰 喝杯茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something cold will do. John, have a cup of tea,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,把这儿当自己家\N{\fnArial\fs30}make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wait up
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看看他 就知道 就知道往外跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him, dashing about...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.23,0:16:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我丈夫也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband was just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.55,0:16:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,看的出来 你是很沉稳的类型\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're more the sitting-down type, I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.43,0:16:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你倒杯茶 歇歇你的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make you that cuppa, you rest your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,它娘的腿  对不起 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn my leg Sorry, I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候这些操蛋的事儿...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just sometimes this bloody thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.90,0:16:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白 亲爱的 我髋骨也不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand, dear, I've got a hip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.69,0:16:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一杯茶就好了 谢谢      - 就说一次 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cup of tea'd be lovely. Thank you. - Just this once, dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是管家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your housekeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.85,0:16:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,再来两块饼干 如果有的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of biscuits too, if you've got 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是你管家哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not your housekeeper
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,(雷斯垂德探长负责调查)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.71,0:16:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,而且是个军医\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact you're an Army doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.77,0:16:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.97,0:16:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,干的好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any good?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.51,0:17:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,非常出色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.23,0:17:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那你一定见过很多伤口 惨死的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen a lot of injuries, then. Violent deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.37,0:17:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,也很难受吧 我想?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of trouble too, I bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 一辈子的都见过了 太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Yes. Enough for a lifetime, far too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,想再看多些吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to see some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.91,0:17:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝啊 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 赫德森太太 不喝茶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry Mrs Hudson, I'll skip the tea. Off out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都不喝了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能的自杀案件? 四起?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible suicides? Four of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.24,0:17:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没理由坐在家里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No point sitting at home
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,人生终于有乐趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when there's finally something fun going on
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,死人了你这么开心 不像话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you, all happy. It's not decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,管他像不像话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares about decent?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.30,0:17:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏开始了 赫德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game, Mrs Hudson, is on
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.88,0:17:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,出租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你有问题要问\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, You've got questions...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.56,0:18:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我们去哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.74,0:18:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,犯罪现场 下个问题?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crime scene. Next?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁 你的职业是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you, what do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.36,0:18:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会猜...私家侦探      - 可是?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd say... private detective. - But?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.94,0:18:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,警察不会去找私家侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the police don't go to private detectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个"咨询侦探" 世界唯一的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a "Consulting Detective". Only one in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这工作是我发明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I invented the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么?      - 每当警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does that mean? - Means when the police...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,找不到方向 他们经常都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}are out of their depth, which is always,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会咨询我\N{\fnArial\fs30}they consult me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.25,0:18:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,警察不会咨询外行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police don't consult amateurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.49,0:18:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨天遇到你时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I met you for the first time yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.99,0:18:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,提到了阿富汗和伊拉克 你看起来很惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said Afghanistan or Iraq. You looked surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你怎么知道?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, how DID you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是知道 是观察到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know, I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.65,0:18:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你的发型 举止是军人的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your haircut, the way you hold yourself says military.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.93,0:18:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 而你说的话     - 物是人非了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But your conversation... - Bit different from my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,说明在巴兹医学院学习过\N{\fnArial\fs30}said trained at Barts...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,所以很明显是军医\N{\fnArial\fs30}so Army doctor, obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.82,0:19:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你的脸晒的比较黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your face is tanned...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.65,0:19:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,可手腕却没晒黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no tan above the wrists.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.97,0:19:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你曾去过国外 可并不是日光浴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been abroad, but not sunbathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.65,0:19:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你的走路时跛的厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your limp's really bad when you walk,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.27,0:19:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,却宁愿站着 不要椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you don't ask for a chair when you stand...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.74,0:19:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,完全忘了伤残\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you forgot about it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,所以至少有点身心障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it's at least partly psychosomatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,也说明因为你的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}That says the original circumstances of the injury
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.35,0:19:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是外伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}were traumatic...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.90,0:19:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,战场上受伤 战场上受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}wounded in action then. Wounded in action,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,苏丹 阿富汗 或者是伊拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}suntan... Afghanistan or Iraq.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你说我有个治疗师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I had a therapist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.93,0:19:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你有伤残心理障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a psychosomatic limp,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.63,0:19:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,当然会有治疗师\N{\fnArial\fs30}of course you've got a therapist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,然后是你的哥哥 因为电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there's your brother. Your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.05,0:19:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,它很贵 能发邮件 听音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's expensive, e-mail enabled, MP3 player.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而你穷到要和人合租\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're looking for a flatshare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.89,0:19:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不是你买的 是个礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't buy this... it's a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,划痕 不只一条 很多很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scratches. Not one, many over time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是和钥匙和硬币放一个口袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's been in the same pocket as keys and coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.60,0:19:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会对自己的奢侈品这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't treat your one luxury item like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,所以它之前还有主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it's had a previous owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,下一点就很简单了 你应该知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next bit's easy. You know it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.59,0:19:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,刻的字?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The engraving?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哈利·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,明显是你家人送你的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly a family member who's given you his old phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.64,0:19:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你父亲 这东西是年轻人玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not your father, this is a young man's gadget.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.59,0:19:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能是表兄弟 可你是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be a cousin, but you're a war hero
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.21,0:19:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,无家可归的战斗英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can't find a place to live...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不像是大家族里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}unlikely you've got an extended family,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:19:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,所以是近亲 那就是兄弟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}not one you're close to. So brother it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.39,0:20:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,然后是克拉若?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Clara, who's Clara?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.13,0:20:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,3个吻代表是浪漫的纪念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three kisses says it's a romantic attachment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.06,0:20:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这个价格应该是老婆送的 不是女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}The expense of the phone says wife, not girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.71,0:20:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是最近给的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have given it to him recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,大概用了6个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's only six months old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.35,0:20:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,婚姻出现问题了 6个月他就送人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage in trouble then... six months on he's given it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是她甩他 也许他会留作纪念\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she'd left HIM, he would have kept it. Sentiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.07,0:20:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他想扔掉 是他甩她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he wanted rid of it. He left HER.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他把手机给你 是希望和你保持联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave the phone to you, so he wants you to stay in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你在找便宜的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking for cheap accommodation,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.69,0:20:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,却不向你兄弟求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're not going to your brother for help...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.61,0:20:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你和他之前有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}that says you've got problems with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.73,0:20:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你喜欢他老婆 也许讨厌他喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you liked his wife, or don't like his drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那你怎么知道他喝酒的事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you possibly know about the drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.11,0:20:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,胡乱猜的 不过挺准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shot in the dark. Good one, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.80,0:20:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,电源插口周围有一些磨损\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power connection... tiny little scuff marks round it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.26,0:20:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他每晚想插进去充电 可手却在发抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every night he plugs it in but his hands are shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.34,0:20:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这在清醒人的手机上是不会出现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never see those marks on a sober man's phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.39,0:20:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,每个酗酒的人都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}never see a drunk's without them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.78,0:20:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你也说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.47,0:20:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我对了 哪里说对了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was right? Right about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,警察不会咨询外行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police don't consult amateurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.91,0:20:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这...太神奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That... was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.18,0:20:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这样觉得?       - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you think so? - Of course it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.36,0:20:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,了不起 真的很了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was extraordinary, it was quite extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:20:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,别人通常不会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what people normally say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别人一般怎么说?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do people normally say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.13,0:21:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piss off
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.31,0:21:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我有哪里猜错了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I get anything wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哈利和我关系不好 从来没好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry and me don't get on, never have,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.89,0:21:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,卡拉若和哈利三个月之前分手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clara and Harry split up three months ago
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.02,0:21:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在闹离婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're getting a divorce,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哈利是酗酒的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Harry is a drinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那全中 没想到所有都猜中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spot on, then. I didn't expect to be right about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哈利是哈莉叶的爱称\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry's short for Harriet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哈利是你的姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry's your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我到底来这儿做什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, what exactly am I supposed to be doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.22,0:21:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.80,0:21:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,老实讲 我到底来这里做什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No... seriously, what am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,总要出点错\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 怪胎      - 我找雷斯垂德探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, freak. - I'm here to see Detective Inspector Lestrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.05,0:21:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.74,0:21:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他请我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.09,0:21:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么?      - 我想他想让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why?  - I think he wants me to take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.71,0:21:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你知道我想什么吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what I think, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 莎莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always Sally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你昨天连家都没有回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even know you didn't make it home last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.21,0:21:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有...这位是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't... Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.42,0:21:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我的同事 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colleague of mine, Dr Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.79,0:21:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,华生医生 莎莉·多诺万警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr Watson, Sergeant Sally Donovan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.47,0:21:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.70,0:22:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,同事? 你竟然有同事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}A colleague? How do YOU get a colleague?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.26,0:22:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他会跟踪你到家吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he follow you home?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.58,0:22:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我出去等是不是比较好...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it be better if I just waited...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.93,0:22:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.28,0:22:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,怪胎来了 我带他进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freak's here. Bringing him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.39,0:22:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 安德森 又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Anderson. Here we are again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.73,0:22:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这是犯罪现场 不许污染它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a crime scene. I don't want it contaminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.09,0:22:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we clear on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.17,0:22:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,非常明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.21,0:22:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你老婆很久不回家了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And is your wife away for long?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.13,0:22:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别装做是你推理出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't pretend you worked that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.59,0:22:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,有人告诉你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody told you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.46,0:22:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你的除臭剂告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your deodorant told me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.49,0:22:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我的除臭剂?\N{\fnArial\fs30}My deodorant?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.51,0:22:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是男士用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for men.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 我喷的当然是男用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, of course it's for men... I'm wearing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.94,0:22:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,和多诺万警官身上的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So's Sergeant Donovan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.00,0:22:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,味道突然消失了 我能进吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh... I think it just vaporised. May I go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.18,0:22:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 不管你在暗示什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, look. Whatever you're trying to imply...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.30,0:22:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都没说 我相信莎莉只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not implying anything. I'm sure Sally came round
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.29,0:22:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,来和你聊聊天 顺便就过夜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a nice little chat, and just happened to stay over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.25,0:22:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜她还帮你擦了地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I assume she scrubbed your floors,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.30,0:22:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,从她膝盖看出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}going by the state of her knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.66,0:23:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你得穿一件这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need to wear one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.55,0:23:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.10,0:23:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.29,0:23:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可他是谁?      - 我说他是我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But who is he? - I said he's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.32,0:23:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你不穿一件吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you going to put one on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.14,0:23:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现场在哪?      - 楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So where are we? - Upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.33,0:23:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你两分钟的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.78,0:23:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,也许需要久一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}May need longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.94,0:23:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,信用卡上显示她叫詹妮弗·温森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name's Jennifer Wilson according to her credit cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.47,0:23:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在用它寻找确切联系地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're running them now for contact details.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.39,0:23:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体在这里并不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hasn't been here long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.04,0:23:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,小孩们发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kids found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.20,0:24:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,住嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.89,0:24:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.39,0:24:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你在思考 干扰了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were thinking. It's annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.07,0:24:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,(左撇子)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.96,0:24:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,(德文 复仇)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.83,0:24:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,(人名 瑞秋)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.41,0:24:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,(湿润)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.23,0:24:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,(干燥)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.33,0:25:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,(湿润)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.72,0:25:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,(干净)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.12,0:25:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,(干净)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.82,0:25:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,(干净)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.01,0:25:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,(脏)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.56,0:25:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,(婚姻不睦  10年以上)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.18,0:25:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,(干净)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.39,0:25:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,(一面干净一面脏)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.86,0:25:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,(经常脱下)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.29,0:25:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,(多次通奸)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.22,0:25:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,发现什么了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.00,0:25:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.18,0:25:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她是德国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's German.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.01,0:25:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,RACHE在德文中是复仇的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rache. It's German for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.73,0:25:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她是想告诉我们什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could be trying to tell us something...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.74,0:25:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢您的参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, thank you for your input.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.20,0:25:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以她是德国人?      - 当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So she's German? - Of course she's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.50,0:25:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,(未来7天天气预报)      她是外地来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's from out of town though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.93,0:25:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她准备在回卡迪夫前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intended to stay in London for one night
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.83,0:25:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在伦敦呆一晚上 这很明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}before returning home to Cardiff. So far, so obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.03,0:25:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 明显?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry... obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.89,0:25:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那这个信息是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the message though?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.19,0:25:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,华生医生 你认为呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr Watson, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.02,0:25:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,信息?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the message?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.56,0:26:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是尸体 你是学医的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the body. You're a medical man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.98,0:26:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们外面有整队人马\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a whole team right outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.36,0:26:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不为我工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.11,0:26:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我排除万难让你来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm breaking every rule letting YOU in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.10,0:26:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是的...因为你需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes... because you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.03,0:26:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.32,0:26:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}God help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.91,0:26:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,华生医生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr Watson Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.70,0:26:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,像他说的那样 请自便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, do as he says. Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.89,0:26:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,安德森 让大家离开几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anderson, keep everyone out for a couple of minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.18,0:26:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧?      - 我来这里做什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well? - What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.23,0:26:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 帮我理清头绪      - 我只想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Helping me make a point. - I'm supposed to
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.68,0:26:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 分担你的房租      - 这个有趣多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- be helping you pay the rent. - This is more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.17,0:26:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有趣?一个女人躺在这里 死掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun? There's a woman lying dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.86,0:26:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,分析很准确 不过希望你再深入点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfectly sound analysis, but I WAS hoping you'd go deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.25,0:26:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.99,0:26:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是窒息死亡 晕过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asphyxiation, probably. Passed out,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.37,0:27:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,被自己的呕吐物塞住\N{\fnArial\fs30}choked on her own vomit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.60,0:27:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,身上没有酒味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't smell any alcohol on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.22,0:27:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是突然发作 可能是药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could have been a seizure. Possibly drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.32,0:27:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道怎么回事 你看了报纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it was, you've read the papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.11,0:27:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,她是自杀者之一 第4个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she's one of the suicides. The fourth...?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.81,0:27:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克 你说两分钟 发现了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock... two minutes, I said, I need anything you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.63,0:27:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,受害者年近30 专业人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victim is in her late 30s. Professional person,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.93,0:27:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,从她的衣着判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}going by her clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.94,0:27:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜是传媒界的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing the media,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.88,0:27:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,穿着显眼的粉色\N{\fnArial\fs30}going by the frankly alarming shade of pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.20,0:27:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她从卡迪夫而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travelled from Cardiff today intending
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.62,0:27:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,准备呆一晚 从箱子大小可以看出\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stay in London one night from the size of her suitcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.52,0:27:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 箱子?      - 箱子 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Suitcase? - Suitcase, Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.70,0:27:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,她结婚至少10年了 但并不愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been married at least ten years, but not happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.60,0:27:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,她有一连串的情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's had a string of lovers
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.85,0:27:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但没人知道她结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but none of them knew she was married.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.66,0:27:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上 你是顺口说说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for God's sake, if you're just making this up...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.53,0:27:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,她的婚戒 至少有10年历史了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her wedding ring. Ten years old at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.14,0:27:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,她其它的饰品都很干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of her jewellery has been regularly cleaned,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.99,0:27:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,唯独婚戒不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not her wedding ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.00,0:27:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是她的婚史\N{\fnArial\fs30}State of her marriage right there
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.54,0:27:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,里面比外面亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}The inside is shinier than the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.28,0:27:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,说明经常被摘掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means its regularyly removed
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.49,0:27:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只有在她摘掉时\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only polishing it gets is
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.92,0:27:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,才算被擦拭一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she works it off her finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.29,0:27:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不是为工作 看她的指甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not for work, look at her nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.63,0:27:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,她不用手工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't work with her hands
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.45,0:27:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那为什么要脱去婚戒?\N{\fnArial\fs30}so who does she remove her rings for?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.66,0:27:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不只有一个情人  她不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not one lover, she'd never sustain
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.81,0:27:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,假装单身那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}the fiction of being single for that long
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.41,0:27:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以更可能有一长串人     厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}so more likely a string of them. Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.74,0:27:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉      - 卡迪夫?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Cardiff?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.63,0:27:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,很明显 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's obvious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.39,0:28:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说不明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not obvious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.64,0:28:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝啊 你们小脑瓜里到底装了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear God, what is it like in your funny little brains,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.75,0:28:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一定很无聊 看她的外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}it must be so boring. Her coat...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.02,0:28:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,有一点潮湿\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's slightly damp,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.77,0:28:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是在最近几个小时内遭遇了暴雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's been in heavy rain the last few hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.60,0:28:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,伦敦这段时间都没下雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}no rain anywhere in London in that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.64,0:28:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,大衣领背面也湿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under her coat collar is damp too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.35,0:28:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,她把它翻起来挡雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's turned it up against the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.10,0:28:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她口袋里有雨伞 可却是干的 没用过\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got an umbrella in her pocket but it's dry and unused.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.72,0:28:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不只有风 是强风 大到不能打伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just wind, strong wind... too strong to use her umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.30,0:28:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,从她的箱子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know from her suitcase
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.30,0:28:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,看出她准备过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she was intending to stay overnight
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.66,0:28:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但是她的旅程没超过两三个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she can't have travelled more than two or three hours
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.63,0:28:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,因为外套还没干\N{\fnArial\fs30}because her coat still hasn't dried.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.30,0:28:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 哪里刚刚有暴雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... where has there been heavy rain
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.90,0:28:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有强风 且在两三小时旅程内?\N{\fnArial\fs30}and strong wind within the radius of that travel time?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.78,0:28:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,卡迪夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cardiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.00,0:28:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太棒了      - 你知道你大声说出来了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fantastic. - Do you know you do that out loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.63,0:28:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 我闭嘴      - 没..关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, I'll shut up. - No, it's... fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.23,0:28:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你一直说旅行箱?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you keep saying suitcase?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.51,0:28:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 它在哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.12,0:28:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,电话里或是记事本上一定有\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must have had a phone or an organiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.42,0:28:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找找瑞秋这个人      - 她写的是瑞秋?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Find out who Rachel is. - She was writing Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.74,0:28:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不 她用德语留了句愤怒遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she was leaving an angry note in German...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.98,0:28:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,当然她写的是瑞秋 不可能是其他词\N{\fnArial\fs30}of course she was writing Rachel, no other word it can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.45,0:28:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是 为什么要等到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is Why did she wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.69,0:28:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,临死时来写?\N{\fnArial\fs30}until she was dying to write it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.30,0:28:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道她有箱子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know she had a suitcase?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.85,0:28:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她的右后跟和小腿肚有泥浆的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiny splash marks on her right heel and calf
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.11,0:28:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,左边却没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}not present on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.08,0:28:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,从泥点的图案可以看出\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was dragging a wheeled suitcase behind her
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.23,0:29:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,她右手拉着一个带轮子的箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}with her right hand, by that splash pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.35,0:29:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,以泥点分布来看 是略小的箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smallish case, going by the spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.41,0:29:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这么小的箱子 对穿衣这么讲究的女士来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Case that size, woman this clothes-conscious...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.37,0:29:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,只够呆一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}could only be an overnight bag
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.42,0:29:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我知道她只带一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we know she was staying one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.11,0:29:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,它在哪里 你们拿去做了什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it, what have you done with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.76,0:29:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There wasn't a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.81,0:29:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.24,0:29:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没箱子 什么箱子都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There wasn't a case. There was never any suitcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.66,0:29:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,箱子  有人找到一个箱子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suitcase Did anyone find a suitcase?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.65,0:29:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,房子里有箱子吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there a suitcase in this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.60,0:29:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 这里没有箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, there was no case
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.62,0:29:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可他们是自己服毒的 吞了药\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they take the poison themselves, swallow the pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.08,0:29:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这个很明显 你们怎么会找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are clear signs, even you lot couldn't miss them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.50,0:29:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 谢谢 那...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, thanks. And...?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.47,0:29:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,所有案子都是谋杀 我不知道方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's murder, all of them. I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.88,0:29:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是自杀 是连环谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're not suicides, they're serial killings.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.56,0:29:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要寻找一个连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a serial killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.68,0:29:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.03,0:29:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,总算有所期待了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always something to look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.88,0:29:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你凭什么这样说?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.93,0:29:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她的箱子 拜托 她的箱子呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her case Come on, where is her case?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.30,0:29:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,自己吃掉了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she eat it
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.43,0:29:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有其他人在现场 带走了她的箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone else was here, and they took her case.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.81,0:29:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以杀手一定是开车到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the killer must have driven here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.28,0:29:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,把箱子忘在车里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgot the case was in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.78,0:29:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,她有可能已经订好酒店 放在里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could have checked into a hotel, left it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.10,0:29:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没去酒店 看她的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's never got to the hotel. look at her hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.36,0:29:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,口红和鞋都是一样颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}She colour-coordinates her lipstick and her shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.08,0:29:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她不可能离开酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd never have left any hotel
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.61,0:29:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果头发还那么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}with her hair still looking...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.60,0:30:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克? 怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock? What is it, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.65,0:30:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,连环杀手总是很难对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serial killers, always hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.63,0:30:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,必须等着他们自己犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to wait for them to make a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.93,0:30:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能干等着!\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.87,0:30:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不用再等了 看看她 好好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we're done waiting. Look at her, really look!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.30,0:30:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,总部 错误找到了 调查卡迪夫那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houston, we have a mistake. Get on to Cardiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.66,0:30:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,去找詹妮弗·威尔森的家人和朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}.Find out who Jennifer Wilson's family and friends were.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.77,0:30:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,去找瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Rachel
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.66,0:30:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 好的 但到底是什么错?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, yeah... but what mistake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.02,0:30:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,粉色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pink!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.37,0:30:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,快干活吧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get on with it...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.72,0:31:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.68,0:31:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,谁? 夏洛克·福尔摩斯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, Sherlock Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.84,0:31:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 他就那么走了 他总是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he just took off. He does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.95,0:31:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他会回来吗?      - 看来不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he coming back? - Didn't look like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.13,0:31:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.06,0:31:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.14,0:31:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我现在是在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Sorry, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.27,0:31:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱克斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brixton.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.15,0:31:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道该去哪里打车吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where I could get a cab?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.20,0:31:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,因为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just er...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.55,0:31:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,呃...\N{\fnArial\fs30}well...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.18,0:31:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.80,0:31:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,去主干道打车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try the main road.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.75,0:31:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.29,0:31:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但你不是他的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.64,0:31:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他根本没有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't HAVE friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.00,0:31:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.40,0:31:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我...我谁也不是 我才刚认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm... I'm nobody. I just met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.40,0:31:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那我建议你 离他远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, bit of advice then. Stay away from that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.49,0:31:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.35,0:31:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他为什么来这里吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why he's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.33,0:31:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没有任何报酬 什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not paid or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.90,0:32:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他喜欢这种场景 能让他兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He likes it. He gets off on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.28,0:32:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,罪案越离奇 他就越兴奋 你知道吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weirder the crime, the more he gets off. And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.63,0:32:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天探案会无法满足他\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day just showing up won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.47,0:32:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天我们会围着一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day we'll be standing round a body
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.24,0:32:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯就是始作俑者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Sherlock Holmes will be the one that put it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.13,0:32:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要那么做?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.36,0:32:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他精神变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he's a psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.59,0:32:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,精神变态很容易无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psychopaths get bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.64,0:32:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多诺万      - 来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Donovan! - Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.64,0:32:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,离夏洛克·福尔摩斯远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.47,0:32:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,出租车 出租车...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi! Taxi...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.83,0:33:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,喂?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.40,0:33:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你左边的大楼上有架监控摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a security camera on the building to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.81,0:33:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.23,0:33:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你是哪位?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.94,0:33:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,哪位?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.46,0:33:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看到摄像头了吗 华生医生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see the camera, Dr Watson?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.64,0:33:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 我看到了       - 看着...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I see it. - Watch...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.31,0:34:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,街对面的大楼上有另一个摄像头 看到了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another camera on the building opposite you. Do u see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.68,0:34:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一个 你右手边大楼的顶层\N{\fnArial\fs30}And finally, at the top of the building on your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.69,0:34:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.24,0:34:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,上车 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get into the car, Dr Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.29,0:34:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我本可以威胁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would make some sort of threat,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.36,0:34:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但你一定很清楚自己的处境\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm sure your situation is quite clear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.24,0:34:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好       - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.03,0:34:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.85,0:34:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,呃...安西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er... Anthea.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.87,0:34:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是你的真名吗?      - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that your real name? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.93,0:35:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm John.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.45,0:35:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.68,0:35:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我有必要问问这是去哪吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any point in asking... where I'm going?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.27,0:35:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}None at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.34,0:35:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.09,0:35:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.38,0:35:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下吧 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a seat, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.70,0:35:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 我有手机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've got a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.73,0:35:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,摄像头那招是很妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, very clever and all that,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.52,0:35:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but er...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.36,0:35:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,打电话给我就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could just phone me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.33,0:35:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,到我手机上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.07,0:36:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要想避开夏洛克·福尔摩斯的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}When one is avoiding the attention of Sherlock Holmes,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.88,0:36:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就该学会谨慎 所以在此见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}one learns to be discreet, hence this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.35,0:36:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你的腿一定很疼 坐下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your leg must be hurting you. Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.57,0:36:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.59,0:36:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你不怎么害怕啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't seem very afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.48,0:36:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不怎么吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't seem very frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.90,0:36:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没错...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.30,0:36:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,军人的勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bravery of the soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.57,0:36:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,勇敢是愚蠢最好听的代言词 你说呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravery is by far the kindest word for stupidity, don't u think?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.26,0:36:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你和夏洛克·福尔摩斯什么关系?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your connection to Sherlock Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.63,0:36:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 我们几乎不认识 我昨天才遇到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have one. I barely know him, I met him... yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.13,0:36:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,才一天工夫 你们就同居了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm, and since yesterday you've moved in with him
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.10,0:36:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还一起查案\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you're solving crimes together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.42,0:36:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这周末是不是就该好事将近了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might we expect a happy announcement by the end of the week?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.57,0:36:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是谁?      - 利益相关者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - An interested party.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.31,0:36:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,对夏洛克? 为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interested in Sherlock? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.31,0:36:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你们不是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing you're not friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.25,0:36:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你也见过他 你想他能有几个朋友?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've met him. How many friends do you imagine he has?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.92,0:36:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我是夏洛克能拥有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the closest thing to a friend
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.68,0:36:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 最近乎朋友的存在      - 你指什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that Sherlock Holmes is capable of having. - And what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.18,0:36:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 敌人      - 敌人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An enemy. - An enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.04,0:37:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在他看来 我绝对是敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In HIS mind, certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.84,0:37:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你问他 他会说我是他的魔王\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were to ask him, he'd probably say his arch-enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.53,0:37:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他喜欢把事情搞得戏剧化\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does love to be dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.26,0:37:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 谢天谢地你没这毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank God YOU'RE above all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.78,0:37:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,(若方便速来贝克街   —夏·福)      我没打扰你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I'm not distracting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.15,0:37:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,一点也没打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not distracting me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.64,0:37:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算继续和夏洛克·福尔摩斯合作下去?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you plan to continue your association with Sherlock Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.62,0:37:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,也许说的不对...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could be wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.85,0:37:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得这不关你事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think that's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.42,0:37:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很难说      - 真不关你事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It could be. - It really couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.50,0:37:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你真的搬进...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you DO move into, erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.16,0:37:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,贝克街 221B号\N{\fnArial\fs30}.. 221B Baker Street,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.96,0:37:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我将非常乐意行方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be happy to pay you a meaningful sum
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.00,0:37:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,定期付你可观报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}of money on a regular basis to ease your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.59,0:37:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.76,0:37:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你不富有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're not a wealthy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.91,0:37:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,交换条件是?\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.36,0:37:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,提供信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Information.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.19,0:37:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不会侵犯隐私 绝不会让你为难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing indiscreet. Nothing you'd feel... uncomfortable with.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.03,0:37:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只需告诉我他在干什么      - 为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just tell me what he's up to. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.14,0:38:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我常常为他担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worry about him. Constantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.67,0:38:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nice of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.95,0:38:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但出于种种原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I would prefer for various reasons
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.88,0:38:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你对此事守口如瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my concern go unmentioned,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.09,0:38:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的关系有点...不太融洽\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have what you might call a... difficult relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.05,0:38:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,(若不方便亦来   —夏·福)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.93,0:38:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不行      - 我还没说具体金额呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - But I haven't mentioned a figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.22,0:38:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.62,0:38:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这么快就对他死心塌地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very loyal VERY quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.89,0:38:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是 我只是不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not, I'm just not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.04,0:38:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"不信任人" 医生写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Trust issues"... it says here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.38,0:38:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.65,0:38:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然不信任其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could it be that you've decided to
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.48,0:38:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,却信任夏洛克·福尔摩斯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}trust Sherlock Holmes of all people?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.28,0:38:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谁说我信任他了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says I trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.30,0:38:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你不像那种轻易交心的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't seem the kind to make friends easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.31,0:38:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,说完了没?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.18,0:38:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.44,0:39:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜已经有人警告过你离他远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I imagine people have already warned you to stay away from him,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.70,0:39:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但我看你左手 你不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can see from your left hand that's not going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.02,0:39:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的什么?      - 给我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My what? - Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.55,0:39:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.89,0:39:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 了不得      - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remarkable. - What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.26,0:39:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这城市大多人都庸庸碌碌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people... blunder round this city,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.86,0:39:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,眼中只有繁华街肆 车来人往\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all they see are streets and shops and cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.55,0:39:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,与夏洛克·福尔摩斯同行 你却能看到战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you walk with Sherlock Holmes, you see the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.70,0:39:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经经历过 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen it already. Haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.60,0:39:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.63,0:39:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你的左手会间歇性震颤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have an intermittent tremor in your left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.23,0:39:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你的医生认为这是创伤后应激障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your therapist thinks it's post-traumatic stress disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.40,0:39:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她觉得你被战争的记忆困扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks you're haunted by memories of your military service.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.29,0:39:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.43,0:40:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.55,0:40:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,炒了她吧 她的方向完全错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire her. She's got it the wrong way round.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.60,0:40:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在正承受压力 但手却稳如磐石\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're under stress right now and your hand is perfectly steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.84,0:40:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是被战争困扰 华生医生...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not haunted by the war, Dr Watson...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.07,0:40:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你想念战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}You miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.11,0:40:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.47,0:40:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,该选阵营了 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to choose a side, Dr Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.14,0:40:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我带你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm to take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.03,0:40:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,(可能很危险   —夏·福)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.94,0:40:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,地址?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Address?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.06,0:40:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,贝克街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, Baker Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.21,0:40:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,贝克街221B号\N{\fnArial\fs30}221B Baker Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.04,0:40:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但我要先去个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need to stop off somewhere first.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.74,0:41:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 你老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.82,0:41:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,能别告诉他我来过这儿吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance you could not tell him this is where I went?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.11,0:41:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 当然      - 你已经告诉他了吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. - You've told him already, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.67,0:41:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.74,0:41:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,呃...你平时有空闲吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey erm... do you ever get any free time?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.38,0:41:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 多的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.60,0:41:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再见      - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.54,0:42:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.53,0:42:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,尼古丁贴片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicotine patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.38,0:42:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,能帮助我思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helps me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.61,0:42:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如今在伦敦当老烟枪很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible to sustain a smoking habit in London these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.46,0:42:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不利大脑运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad news for brain work.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.00,0:42:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,却有利于呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good news for breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.08,0:42:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,呼吸 呼吸乏味透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh... Breathing! Breathing's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.87,0:42:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你一下就三张贴片?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that... three patches?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.09,0:42:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是三张级的难题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a three-patch problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.87,0:42:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.85,0:42:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我快来 我以为很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me to come, I'm assuming it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.26,0:42:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 当然了 我能借用你的手机吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh... yeah, of course. Can I borrow your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.41,0:42:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的手机?      - 不用我自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My phone? - Don't use mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.04,0:42:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,号码很可能被认出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always a chance that my number will be recognised.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.44,0:42:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我网站上就有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on the website.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.41,0:42:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赫德森太太有手机      - 她在楼下呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mrs Hudson's got a phone. - Yeah, she's downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.40,0:42:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我试过大喊 但她耳背\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried shouting but she didn't hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.73,0:43:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我在伦敦城的另一边...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I WAS the other side of London...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.83,0:43:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不是急事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.44,0:43:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,给你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.35,0:43:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要干什么? 这案子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's this about... the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.38,0:43:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她的箱子...      - 她的箱子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Her case... - HER case?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.34,0:43:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她的行李箱 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her suitcase, yes, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.82,0:43:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手拿走了她的行李箱 第一个大错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}The murderer took her suitcase, first big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.89,0:43:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 他拿走了她的箱子 那又怎样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, he took her case. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.17,0:43:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没用的 别无他法 只能冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no use, there's no other way. We'll have to risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.56,0:43:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我桌上有个号码 你帮我发条短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my desk there's a number. I want you to send a text.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.84,0:43:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫我来就是为了...发条短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've brought me here... to send a text.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.15,0:43:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 发短信 号码在我桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Text, yes. The number on my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.26,0:43:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了?      - 刚遇到了你一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong? - Just met a friend of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.86,0:43:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 朋友?      - 敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A friend? - An enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.93,0:43:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 哪一个?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.02,0:44:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,据他说 是你的魔王 人真会有魔王?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your arch-enemy, according to him. Do people have arch-enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.40,0:44:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他有没出钱让你监视我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he offer you money to spy on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.30,0:44:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错      - 你收了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Did you take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.47,0:44:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.10,0:44:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真遗憾 我们本可以平分 下次想清楚点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pity, we could have split the fee. Think it through next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.79,0:44:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是谁?      - 你见过的最危险的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is he? - The most dangerous man you've ever met,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.10,0:44:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不过现在的问题不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not my problem right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.31,0:44:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,发短信 号码在我桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my desk, the number!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.14,0:44:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,詹妮弗·威尔森 这是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer Wilson. That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.12,0:44:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 这不是受害人吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. Wasn't that the dead woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.08,0:44:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 这不重要 输入号码吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. That's not important. Just enter the number.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.31,0:44:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在输号码吗?      - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you doing it? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.06,0:44:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,输完了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you done it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.20,0:44:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是...等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah... hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.33,0:44:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,照我说的 一字不差\N{\fnArial\fs30}These words exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.84,0:44:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,劳里斯顿花园发生了什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened at Lauriston Gardens?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.07,0:44:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定是昏过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have blacked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.68,0:44:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,诺森伯兰街22号\N{\fnArial\fs30}22 Northumberland Street,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.22,0:44:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 请速前来      - 你昏过去了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- please come.  - You blacked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.00,0:44:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 不是 当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.19,0:44:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,打好发出去 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Type and send it. Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.35,0:45:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发出去了吗?       - 地址是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you sent it? - What's the address?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.37,0:45:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,诺森伯兰街22号 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}22 Northumberland Street. Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.27,0:45:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,(劳里斯顿花园发生了什么? 我一定是昏过去了)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.76,0:45:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,(诺森伯兰街22号 请速前来)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.80,0:45:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.93,0:45:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那粉红女郎的箱子 詹妮弗·威尔森的箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the pink lady's case, that's Jennifer Wilson's case.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.94,0:45:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 显然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.05,0:45:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,或许该解释下 我没杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, perhaps I should mention... I didn't kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.85,0:45:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没说你杀了她      - 为什么不?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I never said you did. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.90,0:45:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我发了那条短信 又有她的箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given that text and the fact I have her case
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.38,0:45:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这么想完全符合逻辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a perfectly logical assumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.11,0:45:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,别人常以为你是凶手?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do people usually assume you're the murderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.67,0:45:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 时不时会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now and then, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.17,0:45:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.63,0:45:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个你怎么到手的?      - 找来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you get this? - By looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.63,0:45:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.43,0:45:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手一定载她去了劳里斯顿花园\N{\fnArial\fs30}The killer must have driven her to Lauriston Gardens.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.78,0:45:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,箱子遗落在车里 所以到了他手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could only keep her case by accident if it was in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.28,0:45:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,谁拿这箱子都会引人注目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody could be seen with this case without drawing attention...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.75,0:45:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是男人 按统计学凶手大概是男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}particularly a man, which is statistically more likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.19,0:45:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他迫切想扔掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So obviously he'd feel compelled to get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.12,0:45:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一发现自己带着这箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next thing he knows-he still has it. Wouldn't have taken...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.57,0:45:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不到五分钟就意识到是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}him more than five minutes to realise his mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.95,0:45:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我检查了劳里斯顿花园周边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked every backstreet wide enough for a car
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.27,0:46:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,五分钟车程内每条丢弃大件物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}five minutes from Lauriston Gardens, and anywhere you could
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.07,0:46:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不引人注意的小巷\N{\fnArial\fs30}dispose of a bulky object without being observed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.90,0:46:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不到一小时就找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took me less than an hour to find the right skip.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.58,0:46:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,粉色 仅靠箱子是粉色 就推理出那么多?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pink. You got all that because you realised the case would be pink?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.71,0:46:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是粉色的 显而易见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had to be pink, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.78,0:46:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我没猜到?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't I think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.99,0:46:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.14,0:46:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别那副表情 几乎所有人都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, don't look like that. Practically everyone is.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.11,0:46:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 你发现少了什么没?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look. Do you see what's missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.45,0:46:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,箱子里? 我怎么知道?\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the case? How could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.92,0:46:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,她的手机 她的手机呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her phone. Where's her mobile phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.85,0:46:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体和箱子都没手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no phone on the body, there's no phone in the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.57,0:46:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,她是有手机的 刚还发了短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know she had one. You just texted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.89,0:46:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,也许忘在家里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she left it at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.56,0:46:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,她有一大票情人 必须非常谨慎\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a string of lovers and she's careful about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.56,0:46:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她从不把手机放在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never leaves her phone at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.43,0:46:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要发那条短信?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did I just send that text?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.63,0:46:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是 她的手机现在在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the question is where is her phone NOW?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.66,0:46:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可能丢了      - 没错 或是?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She could have lost it. - Yes, or?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.74,0:46:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手...你觉得凶手拿走了手机?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The murderer... You think the murderer has the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.83,0:46:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,也许她放箱子时 落了手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she... left it when she left her case.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.83,0:46:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,也许凶手出于某种原因把手机拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he took it from her for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.77,0:47:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,无论怎样 手机很有可能在凶手手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, the balance of probability is murderer has her phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.97,0:47:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...我们在干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry... what are we doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.00,0:47:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚给凶手发了短信? 那有什么用?\N{\fnArial\fs30}did I just text a murderer? What good will that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.34,0:47:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,刚杀人几小时后\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few hours after his last victim,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.71,0:47:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手收到只可能来自死者的短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now he receives a text that can only be from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.33,0:47:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,偶然捡到手机的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If somebody had just found that phone
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.58,0:47:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不会理睬这种短信 但是凶手...\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd ignore a text like that, but the murderer...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.33,0:47:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,会惊慌失措的\N{\fnArial\fs30}would panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.39,0:47:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你和警察说了没?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you talked to the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.28,0:47:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,死了4个人 没那时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four people are dead, there isn't time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.45,0:47:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那为什么和我说?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why are you talking to ME?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.15,0:47:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,赫德森太太没收了我那头盖骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson took my skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.45,0:47:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我在代替你那头盖骨?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm basically filling in for your skull?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.23,0:47:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别紧张 你干的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, you're doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.05,0:47:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了      - 什么好了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well? - Well, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.80,0:47:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你大可坐在这里看电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well... you could just sit there and... watch telly.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.66,0:47:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我一块去?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you want me to come with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.65,0:47:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢出门有人陪 大声讲话有助于思维\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like company when I go out, I think better when I talk aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.09,0:47:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,头盖骨出门太招摇了 所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The skull just attracts attention, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.38,0:47:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有问题吗?      - 是的 多诺万警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Problem? - Yeah, Sergeant Donovan.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.79,0:47:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.14,0:47:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,她说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.43,0:47:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,凶案让你兴奋 乐在其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get off on this. You enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.47,0:48:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了"危险" 你转眼就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I said "dangerous", and here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.89,0:48:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.10,0:48:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.04,0:48:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,诺森伯兰街 五分钟走到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Northumberland Street's a five-minute walk from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.12,0:48:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手会笨到真去那儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's stupid enough to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.76,0:48:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我觉得他聪明极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think he's brilliant enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.69,0:48:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,聪明人我喜欢 都巴不得被抓到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the brilliant ones. They're all so desperate to get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.97,0:48:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么?      - 被人赏识\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Appreciation!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.99,0:48:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,受人追捧 终成焦点所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Applause! At long last the spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.78,0:48:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是天才的软肋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the frailty of genius,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.31,0:48:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}it needs an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.85,0:48:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.69,0:48:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是他的狩猎场 城市的中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is his hunting ground. Right here in the heart of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.57,0:48:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,现在知道受害人是被他诱拐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we know his victims were abducted,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.22,0:48:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那就不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.23,0:48:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,受害人都是从繁忙的街道消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because all of his victims disappeared from busy streets,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.95,0:48:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,闹市 但从没人注意到他们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}crowded places, but nobody saw them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.22,0:48:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,想啊 谁虽然素不相识仍让我们信任?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think! Who do we trust, even though we don't know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.43,0:48:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,谁不管到哪里都无人注意?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who passes unnoticed wherever they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.84,0:48:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在人群中狩猎?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who hunts in the middle of a crowd?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.26,0:48:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know. Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.18,0:49:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一点都没想到 你饿吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't the faintest. Hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.28,0:49:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.65,0:49:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,诺森伯兰郡街22号\N{\fnArial\fs30}22 Northumberland Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.36,0:49:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,盯着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.08,0:49:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会走上前去按门铃的 他已经疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not just going to ring the doorbell. He'd need to be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.22,0:49:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经杀了4个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He HAS killed four people.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.21,0:49:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.06,0:49:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.21,0:49:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,菜单上的菜随便点 免费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything on the menu, whatever you want, free.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.03,0:49:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,算在我们帐上 你和你的情人都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the house, for you and for your date.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.95,0:49:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想吃东西吗?      - 我不是他的情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want to eat? - I'm not his date.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.91,0:49:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人帮我洗清了谋杀的嫌疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man got me off a murder charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.80,0:49:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是安吉洛 3年前我向雷斯垂德证明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Angelo. Three years ago I sucessfully proved to Lestrade
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.76,0:49:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,当一起极为残暴的三重谋杀发生时\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the time of a particularly vicious triple murder
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.71,0:49:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,安吉洛正在城市另一头入室抢劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Angelo was in different part of town house-breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.76,0:49:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他洗清了我的名誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cleared my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.71,0:49:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一点点吧 对面有什么动静吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cleared it a bit. Anything happening opposite?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.19,0:49:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.13,0:49:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是他 我会去坐牢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for this man, I'd have gone to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.20,0:49:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你后来还是去坐牢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did go to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.08,0:49:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你们点上蜡烛 更浪漫些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get a candle for the table. It's more romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.96,0:49:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是他的情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not his date!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.50,0:49:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是吃点吧 我们可能要等很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may as well eat. We might have a long wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.46,0:50:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.14,0:50:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,人是没有魔王的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't have arch-enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.78,0:50:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么?      - 在现实生活里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry? - In real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.86,0:50:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,现实生活里是没有魔王的 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no arch-enemies in real life. Doesn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.55,0:50:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没有? 真乏味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't it? Sounds a bit dull.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.27,0:50:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我遇到的是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who did I meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.77,0:50:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那么正常人在"现实生活"中应该有什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do real people have, then, in their... "real lives"?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.48,0:50:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.00,0:50:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们认识的人 喜欢的人 不喜欢的人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}People they know, people they like, people they don't like...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.38,0:50:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,女朋友 男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girlfriends, boyfriends.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.12,0:50:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我没说错 乏味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, as I was saying... dull.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.50,0:50:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说你没有女朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a girlfriend, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.36,0:50:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,女朋友? 不 不是我的菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girlfriend? No, not really my area.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.37,0:50:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.99,0:50:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那你有男朋友吗? 对了 那也没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a... boyfriend? Which is fine, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.58,0:50:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.09,0:50:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这么说你有男朋友?      - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you've got a boyfriend then. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.66,0:50:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.11,0:50:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你无牵无挂 就像我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're unattached. Like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.64,0:51:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.89,0:51:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 嗯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.71,0:51:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我想还是该告诉你 我把工作当成爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should know that I consider myself married to my work,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.88,0:51:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管我受宠若惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and while I'm flattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.47,0:51:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但我真的不想找什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really not looking for any...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.13,0:51:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.24,0:51:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是在试探 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm... not asking. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.90,0:51:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说 怎样都没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, it's all fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.18,0:51:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.00,0:51:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.55,0:51:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,看 对街有辆出租车停下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look across the street. Taxi. It's stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.08,0:51:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没人进去 也没人出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody getting in, and nobody getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.38,0:51:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是出租车?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why a taxi?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.82,0:51:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真聪明 聪明吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's clever. Is it clever?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.37,0:51:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么?      - 那就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why is it clever? - That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.38,0:51:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,别盯着看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.74,0:51:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你就在盯着看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.75,0:51:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不能两个人都盯着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't both stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.06,0:52:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.02,0:52:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我记下了车牌号码      - 你用的上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've got the cab number. - Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.40,0:52:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,右转 单行道 道路施工 红绿灯 公车线路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right turn, one way, roadworks, traffic lights, bus lane,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.83,0:52:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,过街横道 只许左转 红绿灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}pedestrian crossing, left turn only, traffic lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.54,0:52:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,(备用道路)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.08,0:52:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.03,0:52:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,(禁行)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.21,0:52:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,(封路)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.43,0:52:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, John...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.44,0:52:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,请稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}WAIT
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.40,0:53:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 约翰 追不上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, John. We're losing him!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.20,0:53:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,(封路)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.90,0:53:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.72,0:53:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 这边!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No... THIS way!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.22,0:53:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.51,0:53:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,(步行街尾)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.14,0:53:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,(禁行)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.36,0:53:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,(让行)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.97,0:54:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,警察!开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police! Open her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.75,0:54:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.29,0:54:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,牙齿 深肤色 加利佛尼亚人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teeth, tan. What... Californian...?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.39,0:54:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,洛杉矶 圣莫妮卡 刚刚抵达\N{\fnArial\fs30}LA, Santa Monica. Just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.10,0:54:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道的?      - 行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How could you possibly know that? - The luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.72,0:54:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次来伦敦吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably your first trip to London, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.96,0:54:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,根据你的目的地和司机带你绕的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going by your final destination and the route the cabbie takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.04,0:54:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 你们是警察吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry... are you guys the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.93,0:54:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对 一切顺利吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.40,0:54:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.65,0:54:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.22,0:54:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,遇到任何问题请通知我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, any problems... just let us know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.58,0:54:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,总之只是辆碰巧减速的出租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically just a cab that happened to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.43,0:54:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.48,0:54:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是凶手      - 不是凶手 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not the murderer. - Not the murderer, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.48,0:54:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,外国人 强力不在场证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong country, good alibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.46,0:54:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 无懈可击      - 你从哪搞来这个的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- As they go. - Hey, where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.02,0:54:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 雷斯垂德探长?      - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Detective Inspector Lestrade? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.15,0:54:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他一烦我我就偷他东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pickpocket him when he's annoying
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.27,0:55:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这个你留着吧 我房里有的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can keep that one, I've got plenty at the flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.32,0:55:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.99,0:55:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 只是... "欢迎来到伦敦"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, just... "Welcome to London".
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.98,0:55:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喘过气来啦?      - 等你发令\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got your breath back? - Ready when you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.86,0:55:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.16,0:55:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,真是荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.74,0:55:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我做过的最荒谬的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the most ridiculous thing... I've ever done.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.19,0:55:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你还入侵阿富汗了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you invaded Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.06,0:55:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.54,0:55:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们干吗不回餐馆去?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't we back at the restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.06,0:55:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会监视的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can keep an eye out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.46,0:55:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,反正本来也没把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a long shot anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.60,0:55:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们去干什么的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what were we doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.44,0:55:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 打发时间呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just passing the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.94,0:55:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,并且证明一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And proving a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.70,0:55:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 证明什么?       - 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What point? - You.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.07,0:55:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,赫德森太太 华生医生要楼上那间房了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson! Dr Watson WILL take the room upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.18,0:55:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,谁说的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.78,0:55:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,门口那个人说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says the man at the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.08,0:56:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克给我发短信 说你掉了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock texted me. He said you forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.31,0:56:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.53,0:56:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.84,0:56:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克 你做什么啦?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.91,0:56:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赫德森太太?       - 楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mrs Hudson? - Upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.78,0:56:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你们干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.74,0:56:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你会找到箱子的 我不傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I knew you'd find the case, I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.79,0:56:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能私闯我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just break into my flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.20,0:56:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能扣押证物 而且我没私闯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't withhold evidence... and I didn't break in your flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.95,0:56:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那这叫什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you call this then?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.07,0:56:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这是缉毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a drugs bust.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.42,0:56:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 这家伙能是毒虫?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously? This guy... a junkie?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.78,0:56:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你认识他吗?       - 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you met him? - John...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.07,0:56:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,依我看 你大可以在这翻上一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure that You could search this flat all day,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.95,0:56:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也别想找到任何消遣的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wouldn't find anything you could call recreational.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.76,0:56:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 约翰 建议你现在闭嘴吧      - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John, you probably want to shut up now. - But come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.44,0:56:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不       - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No... - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.40,0:56:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你?       - 闭嘴 我不是你的搜查犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You? Shut up! - I'm not your sniffer dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.30,0:56:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不 安德森是我的搜查犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Anderson's my sniffer dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.60,0:57:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,安德森 缉毒你跑来做什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anderson, what are YOU doing here on a drugs bust?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.01,0:57:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我自愿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.29,0:57:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都是 他们都不在缉毒科\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all did. They're not strictly speaking ON the drug squad,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.97,0:57:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不过都很热心\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're very keen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.85,0:57:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是人类眼球吧      - 放回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are these human eyes? - Put those back!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.09,0:57:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在微波炉里啊      - 这是科学实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They were in the microwave. - It's an experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.31,0:57:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,接着找 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep looking, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.98,0:57:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,或者你好好帮我们 我就收队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you could help us properly and I'll stand them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.23,0:57:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真幼稚      - 对付幼儿嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is childish. - Well, I'm dealing with a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.45,0:57:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克 这是我们的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, this is our case.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.55,0:57:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你参加 但你不能单干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm letting you in, but you do not go off on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.44,0:57:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,明白?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.25,0:57:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,什么-你居然假装缉毒来要挟我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What... so you set up a pretend drugs bust to bully me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.65,0:57:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真找到毒品就不算假装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stops being pretend if we find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.51,0:57:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我是清白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.78,0:57:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你的公寓是... 全都清白?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your flat...? All of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.42,0:57:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,连烟都不抽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.46,0:57:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不抽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.25,0:57:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们来合作吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.96,0:57:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找到瑞秋了      - 她是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've found Rachel. - Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.71,0:57:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,詹妮弗·温森的独女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer Wilson's only daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.43,0:57:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她女儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.18,0:57:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她为什么写她女儿的名字 为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would she write her daughter's name? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.53,0:57:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,别管了 箱子找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind that, we found the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.60,0:57:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,某人曾断言箱子在凶手那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to SOMEONE the murderer has the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.10,0:57:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,现在它在我们亲爱的精神病人手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we found it in the hands of our favourite psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.02,0:57:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是精神病 是高功能反社会病\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a psychopath, I'm a high-functioning sociopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.54,0:57:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你专业点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do your research.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.59,0:58:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你得把瑞秋找来 审问她 我也得问她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to bring Rachel in and I need to question her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.60,0:58:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她死了      - 太好了 时间地点原因?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's dead. - Excellent. How, when and why?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.06,0:58:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,有联系吗? 肯定有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a connection? There has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.45,0:58:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不敢说 她死了14年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I doubt it, since she's been dead for 14 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.02,0:58:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,严格说从未活过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically she was never alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.39,0:58:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋是詹妮弗·温森14年前流产的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel was Jennifer Wilson's stillborn daughter, 14 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.90,0:58:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.14,0:58:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这不对头 怎么会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}.. that's not right. How...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.42,0:58:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,她干吗这么做 为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would she do that? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.26,0:58:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,她临死前为啥想女儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would she think of her daughter in her last moments?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.61,0:58:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 果然正宗反社会病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup... sociopath, I'm seeing it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.50,0:58:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她不是想女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't think about her daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.33,0:58:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是用指甲把名字刻在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}She scratched her name on the floor with her fingernails.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.56,0:58:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,她快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.43,0:58:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这很费劲 很痛苦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took effort, it would have hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.68,0:58:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你说受害人都是自己服药的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that the victims all took the poison themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.39,0:58:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是他逼他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he MAKES them take it...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.46,0:58:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 也许他... 跟他们说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, maybe he... I don't know, talks to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.96,0:58:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,也许利用了她女儿的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he used the death of her daughter somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.40,0:58:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对 可那都多少年了 她还郁闷个头啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but that was ages ago. Why would she still be upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.42,0:58:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不对?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.10,0:58:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是不太对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit not good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.24,0:58:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你要死了 被谋杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were dying... If you'd been murdered...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.57,0:58:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你临终会说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your very last few seconds what would you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.87,0:58:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,神啊 救救我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, God, let me live.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.20,0:58:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,发挥点想象力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your imagination!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.17,0:59:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.26,0:59:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对 可假设你聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but if you were clever...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.86,0:59:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,詹妮弗这么多情人 她绝对聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer Wilson running all those lovers... she WAS clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.39,0:59:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她在向我们传达什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's trying to tell us something.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.04,0:59:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,门铃坏了吗? 你叫的车来了 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't the doorbell working? Your taxi's here, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.26,0:59:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我没叫出租车 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't order a taxi. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.23,0:59:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哎哟 翻的这么乱 要找什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear. They're making such a mess. What are they looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.12,0:59:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是缉毒 赫德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a drugs bust, Mrs Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.12,0:59:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,可这是我治腰疼的 是草药...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're just for my hip. They're herbal soothers...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.16,0:59:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,全都闭嘴 别乱动 别说话 别呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, everybody! Don't move. Don't speak, don't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.17,0:59:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我在思考呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.72,0:59:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,安德森 转过去 你太扎眼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anderson, face the other way. You're putting me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.60,0:59:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 我的脸?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? My FACE is
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.10,0:59:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,都给我安静不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody quiet and still.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.20,0:59:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 安德森 转过去      - 老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anderson, turn your back. - Oh, for God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.48,0:59:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,马上转过去 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your back, now, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.00,0:59:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 加油 快想啊      - 车怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, think. Quick! - What about your taxi?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.62,0:59:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,赫德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}MRS HUDSON!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.22,0:59:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她很聪明 聪明 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was clever. Clever, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.78,0:59:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她比你们都聪明 她还死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's cleverer than you lot and she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.93,0:59:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see, do you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.10,0:59:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,手机不是丢了 根本没丢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't lose her phone, she never lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.04,0:59:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,她栽给凶手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She PLANTED it on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.78,0:59:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,她下车的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she got out of the car,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.20,0:59:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就预料到要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she knew that she was going to her death.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.62,0:59:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,她留下了手机 追踪凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left the phone in order to lead us to her killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.19,1:00:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么追踪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.09,1:00:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫怎么追踪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, how?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.16,1:00:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.82,1:00:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还不懂? 瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see? Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.26,1:00:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你们 一群草包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you lot. You're all so vacant.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.18,1:00:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我的感觉很好吧? 多轻松啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it nice not being me? It must be so relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.50,1:00:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋不是人名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel is not a name.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.68,1:00:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.21,1:00:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 行李上有个标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}John... on the luggage, there's a label.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.54,1:00:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,电子邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}E-mail address.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.38,1:00:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,jennie.pink@mephone.org.uk\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, jennie. pink@mephone. org. uk.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.94,1:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她没带电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't have a laptop,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.22,1:00:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,所以肯定用手机办公\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means she did her business on her phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.18,1:00:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,智能机 绑定邮箱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A smartphone, it's e-mail enabled.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.16,1:00:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,有个网站能登陆她的账号\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there was a website for her account.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.96,1:00:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,用户名就是电邮地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}The username is her e-mail address...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.66,1:00:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,猜猜看 密码呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all together, the password is?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.32,1:00:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.51,1:00:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能看她邮件 所以呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we can read her e-mails. So what?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.15,1:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,安德森 别嚷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anderson, don't talk out loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.46,1:00:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,整条街智商都被你拉低了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lower the IQ of the whole street.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.95,1:00:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,何止是邮件 这是智能手机 有卫星定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do much more than that. It's a smartphone, it's got GPS.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.78,1:00:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说如果遗失 可以上网追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means if you lose it you can locate it online.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.09,1:00:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她要把我们带到凶手面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's leading us directly to the man who killed her.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.17,1:00:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 除非他扔了      - 我们知道他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Unless he got rid of it. - We know he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.42,1:00:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.94,1:00:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克亲爱的 那个出租车司机...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, dear. This taxi driver...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.29,1:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,赫德森太太 你晚上该用药了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson, isn't it time for your evening soother?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.90,1:01:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,调车 调直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get vehicles, get a helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.07,1:01:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,手机电池是有限的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This phone battery won't last for ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.72,1:01:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,只有地图 没有凶手名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just have a map reference, not a name.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.86,1:01:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这是突破口\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a start!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.46,1:01:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克      - 至少不是全城都有嫌疑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock... - Narrows it down from just anyone in London.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.82,1:01:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是我们第一条靠谱线索      - 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the first proper lead that we've had. - Sherlock...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.16,1:01:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪 快说 在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it? Quickly, where?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.56,1:01:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里 贝克街221号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. It's... in 221 Baker Street.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.66,1:01:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会在这里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can it be here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.98,1:01:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.28,1:01:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,也许在你带回的箱子里...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it was in the case when you brought it back and it...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.49,1:01:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,掉出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}fell out somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.37,1:01:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没发现? 我——没发现?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, and I didn't notice it? Me... I didn't notice?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.82,1:01:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,反正 我们的短信他回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, we texted him and he called back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.06,1:01:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,注意了 在这幢楼里找一个手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, we're also looking for a mobile somewhere here,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.20,1:01:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,受害人的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}belonged to the victim...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.95,1:01:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,谁虽然素不相识仍让我们信任?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do we trust, even if we don't know them?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.90,1:01:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,(伦敦出租车司机71126)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.10,1:01:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谁不管到哪里都无人注意?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who passes unnoticed wherever they go?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.32,1:01:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在人群中狩猎?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who hunts in the middle of a crowd?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.88,1:02:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,(跟我来)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.84,1:02:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 你没事吧      - 什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock, you OK? - What...?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.02,1:02:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对 对 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah... I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.26,1:02:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那手机为什么在这?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how can the phone be here?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.12,1:02:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.46,1:02:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我再试试      - 好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll try it again. - Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.58,1:02:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.88,1:02:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,出去透气 就去一会 马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fresh air, just popping outside for a moment. Won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.70,1:02:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你真的没事?       - 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure you're all right? - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.18,1:03:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi for Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.26,1:03:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我没叫出租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't order a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.34,1:03:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但你未必不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean you don't need one.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.30,1:03:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你是那个出租司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the cabbie.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.43,1:03:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,停在诺森伯兰街外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one who stopped outside Northumberland Street.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.16,1:03:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你 不是乘客\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you. Not your passenger.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.51,1:03:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你瞧 没人会想到出租司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? No-one ever thinks about the cabbie.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.50,1:03:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就像是透明人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like you're invisible.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.50,1:03:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,永远被人抛到脑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the back of an 'ead.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.30,1:03:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,对连环杀手 真是得天独厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proper advantage for a serial killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.34,1:03:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你认罪了?       - 哦 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this a confession? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.69,1:03:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,再告诉你件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what else...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.41,1:03:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你现在叫警察 我不逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you call the coppers now, I won't run.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.66,1:03:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我乖乖坐着 束手就擒 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll sit quiet and they can take me down, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.32,1:03:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.74,1:03:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为你不会的      - 我不会吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cos you're not going to do that. - Am I not?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.40,1:04:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我没杀那四个人 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't kill those four people, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.54,1:04:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟他们聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spoke to 'em...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.70,1:04:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就自行了断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they killed themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.26,1:04:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你现在叫警察 我保证一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get the coppers now, I'll promise you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.86,1:04:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远不告诉你我说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never tell you what I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.90,1:04:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不过再也没人会死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-one else will die, though,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.11,1:04:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信他们也能结案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I believe they call that a result.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.42,1:04:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你也永远不知道他们怎么死的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you won't ever understand how those people died.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.02,1:04:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要哪种结案?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of result do you care about?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.06,1:04:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我想要真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wanted to understand...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.66,1:04:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我该怎么做?       - 我请你兜个风\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what would I do? - Let me take you for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.15,1:04:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好把我也杀掉?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can kill me too?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.51,1:04:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我没想杀你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to kill you, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.34,1:04:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想跟你聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to talk to ya...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.70,1:05:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你就自行了断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}.. and then you're going to kill yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.94,1:05:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他上出租车了 是夏洛克 他坐车走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just got in a cab... It's Sherlock. He just drove off in a cab.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.46,1:05:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我说吧 他就是这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, he does that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.06,1:05:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,又被他跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bloody left again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.70,1:05:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're wasting our time!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.66,1:05:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我打手机试试 开了响铃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm... calling the phone, it's ringing out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.94,1:05:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,如果开了响铃 那它不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it's ringing, it's not here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.57,1:05:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我再定位试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try the search again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.49,1:05:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有关系吗 有意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it matter? Does any of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.48,1:05:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个疯子 总会让你失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just a lunatic, and he'll always let you down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.80,1:05:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你在浪费时间 大家的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're wasting your time. All our time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.72,1:06:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, everybody...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.74,1:06:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,收工\N{\fnArial\fs30}done here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.76,1:06:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.57,1:06:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我认出你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I recognised ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.98,1:06:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就在你追我车的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as I saw you chasing my cab.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.88,1:06:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.10,1:06:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有人警告我提防你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was warned about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.46,1:06:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我还上过你的网站 真不错 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been on your website, too. Brilliant stuff! Loved it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.15,1:06:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁警告你?       - 某个注意到你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who warned you about me? - Just someone out there who's noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.93,1:06:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.40,1:06:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会注意到我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would notice me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.41,1:06:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你真谦虚 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too modest, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.77,1:06:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really not.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.56,1:06:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你有个粉丝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got yourself a fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.52,1:06:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,给我讲讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.34,1:06:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只告诉你这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you're going to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.34,1:06:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,在这辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}In THIS lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.20,1:06:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他这是干啥 他跑什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did he do that? Why did he have to leave?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.21,1:06:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你比我了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know him better than I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.09,1:07:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识他5年了 不 我不了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've known him for five years... and no, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.78,1:07:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为什么忍受他?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why do you put up with him?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.87,1:07:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我是死马当活马医啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm desperate, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.70,1:07:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,也因为夏洛克·福尔摩斯是个伟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because Sherlock Holmes is a great man...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.72,1:07:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想有一天 如果我们大家走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think one day, if we're very, very lucky,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.83,1:07:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能还会成为好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}he might even be a good one.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.66,1:07:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.14,1:07:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你熟悉伦敦的大街小巷 你知道这是哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know every street in London. You know exactly where we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.59,1:07:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,罗兰克尔专科学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roland-Kerr Further Education College.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.67,1:07:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么来这儿?       - 门开着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why here? - It's open.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.26,1:07:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,清洁工在打扫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleaners are in.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.30,1:07:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,开出租有个特点\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing about being a cabbie...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.90,1:07:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,随时知道哪有僻静处适合谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}you always know a nice quiet spot for a murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.54,1:08:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真不明白我的同行们怎么不试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised more of us don't branch out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.18,1:08:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,受害人就跟你走进去? 为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just walk your victims in? How?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.10,1:08:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真没劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh... Dull.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.16,1:08:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 好戏在后头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. It gets better.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.78,1:08:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能拿枪逼人自行了断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't make people take their own lives at gunpoint.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.64,1:08:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.14,1:08:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,比那要好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's much better than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.90,1:08:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,对你不需要 因为你会跟着我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't need this with you. Cos you'll follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.27,1:09:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.28,1:09:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.24,1:09:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟你要在这送命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who's going to die here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.12,1:09:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不会的      - 他们都这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm not. - That's what they all say.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.10,1:09:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们聊聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.44,1:09:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这不会有点冒险吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit risky, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.04,1:09:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,在一群警察眼皮底下把我带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took me away under the eye of about half a dozen policemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.19,1:09:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他们没那么傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not that stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.40,1:09:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,赫德森夫人也会记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mrs Hudson will remember you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.55,1:09:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你管这叫风险? 嘁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call that a risk? Nah...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.42,1:09:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这才叫风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}THIS is a risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.22,1:10:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我最爱这部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I like this bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.86,1:10:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你还不明白 是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cos you don't get it yet, do ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.72,1:10:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're about to.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.50,1:10:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我拿出这个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have to do this...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.42,1:10:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这你可没料到吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weren't expecting that, were ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.32,1:10:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这个保证你喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're going to love this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.75,1:10:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love what?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.97,1:10:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯 看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes! Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.02,1:10:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是你 你那个网站 你的粉丝给我讲过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here in the flesh. That website of yours, your fan told me about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.65,1:10:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我的粉丝?\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fan?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.25,1:10:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你确实厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.42,1:10:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不世出的天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a proper genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.56,1:10:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"演绎法研究" 我说 这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Science of Deduction. Now, that...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.78,1:10:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,才叫思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}is proper thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.36,1:10:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你我私下说说 为什么人们都不会思考?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between you and me sitting here, why can't people think?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.58,1:10:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你也快被逼疯了吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't it make you mad?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.76,1:11:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们怎么就不会思考呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't people just think?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.64,1:11:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 明白了 原来你也是不世出的天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I see... So you're a proper genius too.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.70,1:11:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去不像 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look it, do I?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.38,1:11:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,开出租的小老头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny little man driving a cab.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.26,1:11:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可你马上就会醒悟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'll know better in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.84,1:11:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这有可能是你今生知道的最后一件事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chances are it'll be the last thing you EVER know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.98,1:11:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 两个瓶子 解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, two bottles. Explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.90,1:11:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,一个好瓶子 一个坏瓶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a good bottle and a bad bottle.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.42,1:11:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了好瓶子里的药 你就活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take the pill from the good bottle, you live.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.52,1:11:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了坏瓶子里的药 你就死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take the pill from the bad bottle... you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.28,1:11:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 两个瓶子是一样的吧      - 分毫不差\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Both bottles are of course identical. - In every way.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.81,1:11:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但你能分辨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know which is which.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.06,1:11:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.93,1:11:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,可我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.74,1:11:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道就不好玩了 你来选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't be a game if you knew. You're the one who chooses.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.43,1:11:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我凭什么? 没理由 我能赢得什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I? I've got nothing to go on. What's in it for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.32,1:11:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没告诉你最好的事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't told you the best bit yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.38,1:11:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你选哪瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever bottle YOU choose,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.62,1:11:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我都拿另一瓶的药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take the pill from the other one.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.06,1:11:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们同时...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then together...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.46,1:12:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,把药吃下\N{\fnArial\fs30}we take our medicine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.26,1:12:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会作弊 由你选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't cheat. It's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.42,1:12:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我就吃你剩下的药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take whatever pill you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.54,1:12:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这你可没料到吧 福尔摩斯先生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't expect that, did you, Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.51,1:12:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你对他们做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you did to the rest of them...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.47,1:12:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给他们选择?       - 现在我给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you gave them a choice? - And now I'm giving you one.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.72,1:12:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不必着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.54,1:12:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,理清思绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.38,1:12:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,拿出你最好的策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want your best game.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.68,1:12:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是策略 这是50:50的概率\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a game, it's a 50:50 chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.86,1:12:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我玩了四局了 我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've played four times. I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.16,1:12:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是概率 福尔摩斯先生 这是下棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not chance, Mr Holmes, it's chess.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.54,1:12:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一局棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a game of chess,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.08,1:12:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一步 只有一方能活\N{\fnArial\fs30}with one move... and one survivor.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.56,1:12:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,而这 这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this... this...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.20,1:12:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就是唯一一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the move.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.00,1:13:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚给你的是好瓶子还是坏瓶子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I just give you the good bottle or the bad bottle?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.60,1:13:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,随你选一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can choose either one.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.94,1:13:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不 找雷斯垂德探长 我有话跟他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Detective Inspector Lestrade... I need to speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.76,1:13:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,非常重要 十万火急\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's important. It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.46,1:13:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这里左转 谢谢 左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, left here, please. Left here...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.24,1:13:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 福尔摩斯先生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready yet, Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.48,1:13:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,开始玩吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to play?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.63,1:13:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,玩什么? 这是50:50的概率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play what? It's a 50:50 chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.12,1:13:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你赌的不是数字 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not playing the numbers, you're playing ME.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.50,1:13:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚给你的是好药还是坏药?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I just give you the good pill or the bad pill?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.29,1:13:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这是诈术吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a bluff,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.42,1:13:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,还是反诈\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a double bluff?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.46,1:13:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还是三重反诈?       - 仍然只是概率\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or a triple bluff? - It's still just chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.28,1:13:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,一连四个人? 这不是概率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four people, in a row? It's not chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.06,1:13:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 运气      - 这是天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Luck. - It's genius!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.08,1:13:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道人们的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how people think.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.96,1:13:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道人们以为我怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how people think I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.06,1:13:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我脑子里仿佛有张地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see it all like a map inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.48,1:14:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,人人都那么蠢 甚至你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's so stupid, even you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.82,1:14:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,或者神就是眷顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe God just loves me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.94,1:14:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不管哪样 你开出租都算糟蹋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, you're wasted as a cabbie.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.32,1:14:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.04,1:14:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿命赌了四次 杀了几个路人 为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You risked your life four times just to kill strangers? Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.75,1:14:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to play.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.16,1:14:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我正在玩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I am playing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.36,1:14:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,轮到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.34,1:14:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你左耳后沾着剃须泡沫\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's shaving foam behind your left ear.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.42,1:14:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没人提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's pointed it out to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.82,1:14:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,从痕迹来看不止一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traces of where it's happened before,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.07,1:14:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,显然你是独居 没人提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}so obviously you live on your own... there's no-one to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.04,1:14:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可你有孩子的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's a photograph of children.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.67,1:14:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子母亲被切掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children's mother's been cut out of the picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.17,1:14:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她死了 她还会在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she'd died, she'd still be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.26,1:14:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,照片很旧 但框很新\N{\fnArial\fs30}The photograph's old, but the frame's new.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.93,1:14:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你想念孩子 但不能去看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think of your children, but you don't get to see them.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.72,1:14:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,疏离的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Estranged father.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.00,1:14:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,她带走了孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took the kids,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.78,1:14:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可你还爱他们 还为此痛苦着\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you still love them and it still hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.49,1:15:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 可不止这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, but there's more.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.42,1:15:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你的衣服 刚刚洗过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your clothes. Recently laundered,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.54,1:15:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但你身上每件衣物至少...穿了三年了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}but everything you're wearing is at least... three years old?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.00,1:15:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,保持仪表 却无长远规划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping up appearances, but not planning ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.18,1:15:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,现在又沉迷于自毁式谋杀 这是为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here you are on a kamikaze murder spree. What's that about?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.50,1:15:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,三年前 他们是那时告诉你的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three years ago. Is that when they told you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.64,1:15:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told me what?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.69,1:15:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,（濒死）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.91,1:15:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说你死到临头了      - 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That you're a dead man walking. - So are you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.32,1:15:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have long, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.21,1:15:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的对吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.00,1:15:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,动脉瘤 就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aneurism. Right in 'ere.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.34,1:15:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,每一口气都可能是最后一息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any breath could be my last.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.54,1:15:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你要死了 你就杀了四个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because you're dying, you've just murdered four people.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.23,1:15:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我活赢了四个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've outlived four people.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.52,1:15:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对动脉瘤患者 这是最开心的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the most fun you can have with an aneurism.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.86,1:15:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 还有别的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}No... No, there's something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.62,1:15:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是因为愤懑杀了四个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't just kill four people because you're bitter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.66,1:16:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,愤懑是种麻醉剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitterness is a paralytic.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.08,1:16:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,更危险的动机是爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love is a much more vicious motivator.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.42,1:16:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不知为什么 这是为了你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, this is about your children.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.70,1:16:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确实厉害 是吗?       - 可为什么呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ARE good, in't ya? - But how?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.56,1:16:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我死了 我的孩子们拿不到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I die they won't get much, my kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.82,1:16:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,开出租不挣钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a lot of money in driving cabs.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.74,1:16:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 连环杀人也是      - 这你可失算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or serial killing. - You'd be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.67,1:16:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.32,1:16:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个赞助人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a sponsor.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.70,1:16:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a what?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.70,1:16:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我每取一条命 孩子们就会拿到钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}For every life I take, money goes to my kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.03,1:16:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我杀的越多 他们过得越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more I kill... the better off they'll be.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.96,1:16:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 比你想的要划算\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? It's nicer than you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.51,1:16:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会赞助连环杀手?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd sponsor a serial killer?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.78,1:16:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会迷恋夏洛克·福尔摩斯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd be a fan of Sherlock Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.82,1:16:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不是只有你能欣赏精彩的谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the only one to enjoy a good murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.95,1:16:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,世上还有你的同类 只不过你是孤家寡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's others out there just like you, except u're just a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.86,1:17:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,而他们远远不止于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're so much more than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.08,1:17:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.82,1:17:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不止一个人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than a man?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.04,1:17:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,一个组织? 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}An organisation...? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.22,1:17:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个名字 从没有人提起\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a name, that no-one says.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.02,1:17:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not going to say it either.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.58,1:17:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,闲话聊够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, enough chatter.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.90,1:17:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,该做选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to choose.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.88,1:17:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.12,1:17:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.92,1:17:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我都不选呢? 我可以直接走掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I don't choose either? I could just walk out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.93,1:17:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要么你赌50:50的概率\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take a 50:50 chance,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.92,1:17:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,要么我一枪爆你头\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I can shoot you in the head.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.68,1:17:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funnily enough,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.22,1:17:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,从没人选这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}no-one's ever gone for that option.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.68,1:17:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我选择枪 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have the gun, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.58,1:18:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.04,1:18:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,确定 枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely. The gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.11,1:18:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想给朋友打个电话?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to phone a friend
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.86,1:18:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.14,1:18:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,枪的真假我一看便知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a real gun when I see one.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.70,1:18:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们都看不出      - 显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- None of the others did. - Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.08,1:18:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这游戏很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this has been very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.90,1:18:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,期待在法庭上再会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look forward to the court case.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.63,1:18:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,走之前问一句 你想出来了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just before you go, did you figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.89,1:18:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个是好瓶子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one's the good bottle?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.07,1:18:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 小菜一碟\N{\fnArial\fs30}OF Course. Child's play.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.54,1:18:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 哪一个?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, which one, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.49,1:18:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你会选哪一个?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one would you have picked?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.78,1:18:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,让我知道我会不会赢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so I know whether I could have beaten you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.96,1:18:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.98,1:18:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,把游戏玩完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.70,1:19:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.98,1:19:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你看怎样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.10,1:19:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一起吃?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.98,1:19:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 你觉得呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really... What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.42,1:19:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你能赢我吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you beat me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.28,1:19:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是聪明到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you clever enough...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.31,1:19:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,能赌自己的命?\N{\fnArial\fs30}.. to bet your life?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.90,1:19:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}SHERLOCK!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.49,1:19:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我打赌你常常无聊 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you get bored, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.52,1:19:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.97,1:20:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样的人 这么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man like you. So clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.40,1:20:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但你证明不了 那么再聪明又有什么用?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what's the point of being clever if you can't prove it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.70,1:20:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,仍然是瘾君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still the addict.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.94,1:20:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,可这个...这才是你真正的瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this... this is what you're really addicted to.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.04,1:20:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你会做一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll do anything...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.36,1:20:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不惜一切代价 来摆脱无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}.. anything at all, to stop being bored.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.32,1:20:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在不无聊了 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not bored now, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.83,1:20:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是很好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it good?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.56,1:20:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的对吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was I right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.10,1:20:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我说中了 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was, wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.06,1:20:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我选对了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I get it right?!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.35,1:20:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK... Tell me this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.29,1:21:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你的赞助人 是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sponsor. Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.01,1:21:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,给你讲我的人 我的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one who told you about me, my fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.43,1:21:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,给我个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a name.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.91,1:21:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.80,1:21:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你快死了 但要折磨你还来得及\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dying, but there's still time to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.66,1:21:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,给我一个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me... a name.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.04,1:21:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,名字 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}A name! Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.60,1:21:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.60,1:21:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}MORIARTY!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.43,1:21:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么给我毯子? 他们老给我披毯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why have I got this blanket? They keep putting this blanket on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.04,1:21:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 安抚受刺激人士的      - 我没受刺激呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, it's for shock. - I'm not in shock.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.34,1:21:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 可有些人需要拍照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but some of the guys want to take photographs.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.54,1:21:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪的人呢 没痕迹?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the shooter. No sign?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.16,1:21:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,趁我们没到逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleared off before we got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.83,1:22:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不过那种人有仇家也挺正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a guy like that would have had enemies, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.09,1:22:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可能有人跟踪他来 不过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them could have been following him, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.67,1:22:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们毫无线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've got nothing to go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.13,1:22:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我可不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.64,1:22:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Give me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.56,1:22:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,墙里挖出的子弹是手枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bullet they just dug out of the wall's from a handgun.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.09,1:22:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,隔这么远一枪毙命\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kill shot over that distance,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.55,1:22:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要找的是个神枪手\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's a crack shot,WE ARE LOOKING FOR.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.28,1:22:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不止枪法好 他是个战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not just a marksman, a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.00,1:22:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,手丝毫没有抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}His hands couldn't have shaken at all
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.73,1:22:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,可见他熟悉暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}so clearly he's acclimatised to violence.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.39,1:22:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但直到我命悬一线才开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't fire until I was in immediate danger though,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.12,1:22:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可见道德感极强\N{\fnArial\fs30}so strong moral principle.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.57,1:22:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你要找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking for a man
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.65,1:22:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,大概服过兵役 而且...\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably with a history of military service, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.62,1:22:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,沉着果敢 坚韧如钢...\N{\fnArial\fs30}nerves of steel...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.27,1:22:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 我说 别理我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, do you know what? Ignore me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.85,1:22:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么?      - 别听我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry? - Ignore all of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.37,1:22:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那是...受刺激说胡话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the er... the shock talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.26,1:22:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.75,1:22:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去谈...房租\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to... talk about the rent.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.75,1:22:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还有话问你      - 又怎么啦?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've still got questions. - What now?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.69,1:22:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我受刺激了 看 都披毯子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in shock... look, I've got a blanket.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.47,1:22:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.27,1:22:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我刚给你抓住个连环杀手...多少算吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, I just caught you a serial killer... More or less.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.46,1:23:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 明天再找你 你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. We'll pull you in tomorrow, off you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.46,1:23:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,多诺万警官... 解释了事情经过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erm... Sergeant Donovan has... just been explaining everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.56,1:23:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那两颗药丸...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two pills...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.10,1:23:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,真阴毒对吧? 真阴毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreadful business, isn't it? Dreadful.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.34,1:23:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好枪法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.44,1:23:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对对 肯定很难 还隔着窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, must have been. Through that window.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.15,1:23:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 你最清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you'd know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.36,1:23:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,得把你手上的火药灼伤弄掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to get the powder burns out of your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.80,1:23:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不会判你刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose you'd serve time for this,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.24,1:23:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们还是别上法庭的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but let's avoid the court case.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.72,1:23:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧      - 对 我当然没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? - Yes, of course. I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.86,1:23:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你刚杀了一个人      - 对...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you have just killed a man. - Yes...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.48,1:23:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's true, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.39,1:23:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,可他也不是什么好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he wasn't a very nice man.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.66,1:23:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,对 他可真不是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, he wasn't, really, was he?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.46,1:23:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,什么破司机啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly a bloody awful cabbie.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.62,1:23:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就是 他根本不会开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's true, he was a bad cabbie.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.67,1:23:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你该瞧瞧他开过来绕的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have seen the route he took us to get here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.21,1:23:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能笑 这是杀人现场啊 快别说啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! We can't giggle, it's a crime scene. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.74,1:24:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 你可是凶手啊      - 小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you're the one who shot him. - Keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.41,1:24:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我有点...亢奋 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, it's just erm... nerves, I think. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.67,1:24:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你真打算吃那颗药了 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were going to take that damn pill, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.66,1:24:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我才没有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Course I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.88,1:24:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我是拖延时间 就知道你会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biding my time. Knew you'd turn up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.73,1:24:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你哪知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.58,1:24:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你找刺激的方式 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you get your kicks, isn't it...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.02,1:24:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,赌上性命证明你聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}you risk your life to prove you're clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.43,1:24:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么呀?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.87,1:24:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.39,1:24:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 吃饭去?       - 饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dinner? - Starving.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.95,1:24:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,贝克街有家中餐馆不错 开到凌晨2点\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of Baker Street there's a good Chinese. Stays open till two.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.63,1:24:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看中餐馆好坏 要看门把手底部1/3\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can tell a good Chinese by the bottom third of the door handle.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.28,1:24:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克 就是他 我跟你说的那人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock... That's him, that's the man I was talking to you about.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.91,1:24:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常清楚他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly who that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.68,1:24:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好呀 又一个案子破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... Another case cracked.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.17,1:24:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真是造福大众啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How very public-spirited.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.70,1:24:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这从来就不是你的动机 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though that's never really your motivation, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.86,1:24:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你来这干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.20,1:24:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,照例 我来关心你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As ever, I'm concerned about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.30,1:24:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我听说你的"关心"了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I've been hearing about your "concern".
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.70,1:24:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还是这么别扭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always so aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.42,1:24:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你就没想过我和你是一个阵营的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it never occur to you that you and I belong on the same side?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.75,1:24:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,真奇怪 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oddly enough... no.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.67,1:25:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的共同点可比你愿意相信的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have more in common than you'd like to believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.57,1:25:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩这种意气之争实在太幼稚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This petty feud between us is simply childish.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.37,1:25:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,总是殃及无辜 你也知道这惹妈妈生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}People will suffer. And you know how it always upset Mummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.80,1:25:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我惹妈妈生气?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I upset her?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.21,1:25:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.50,1:25:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,惹她的可不是我 麦克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't me that upset her, Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.70,1:25:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 喂 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, wait...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.50,1:25:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈? 谁是妈妈?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mummy? Who's Mummy?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.92,1:25:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲 我们的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother. Our mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.70,1:25:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我哥哥 麦克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my brother, Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.51,1:25:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你又增重啦?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting on weight again?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.50,1:25:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 是减了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing it, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.87,1:25:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他是你哥哥?\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's your brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.18,1:25:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他当然是我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Course he's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.06,1:25:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那他不是...      - 不是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So he's not... - Not what?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.30,1:25:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 地下阴谋家?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know... Criminal mastermind?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.94,1:25:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 差不多吧      - 老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Close enough. - For goodness' sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.16,1:25:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是英国政府里小小的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I occupy a minor position in the British government.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.78,1:25:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是英国政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}He IS the British government,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.87,1:25:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在他不忙着当英国情报局的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he's not too busy being the British secret service
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.63,1:25:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,或者不跑去客串美国中情局的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the CIA on a freelance basis.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.64,1:25:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好 麦克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.58,1:25:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在我到家前请尽量别发动战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to start a war before I get home,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.37,1:25:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道交通会变成什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know what it does for the traffic.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.84,1:25:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你说你关心他的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when you say you're concerned about him...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.18,1:26:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真是关心他?\N{\fnArial\fs30}you actually are concerned?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.61,1:26:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.90,1:26:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我说 这真的是小孩子赌气?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it actually is a childish feud?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.42,1:26:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他一贯这么气鼓鼓的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's always been so resentful.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.87,1:26:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,能想象我们家圣诞晚宴什么样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can imagine the Christmas dinners.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.24,1:26:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.29,1:26:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不 天啊 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No... God, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.58,1:26:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd better erm...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.66,1:26:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello again.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.94,1:26:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好      - 我们今天傍晚见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - We met earlier on this evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.28,1:26:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦      - 好吧 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh! - OK. Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.15,1:26:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, Dr Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.58,1:26:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 吃点心去      - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, dim sum. - Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.10,1:26:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我总能猜到幸运饼里的签语      - 吹吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can always predict the fortune cookies. - No, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.35,1:26:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,几乎能 话说你还是中过枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost can. You did get shot, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.62,1:26:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么?       - 在阿富汗 确实受过伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry? - In Afghanistan. There was an actual wound.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.04,1:26:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 对 肩膀      - 肩膀 我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. Yeah, shoulder. - Shoulder! I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.42,1:26:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 才怪      - 左边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you didn't. - The left one.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.95,1:26:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 算你蒙对了      - 我从不瞎蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lucky guess. - I never guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.62,1:26:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是瞎蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.36,1:26:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你兴奋什么呢?       - 莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you so happy about? - Moriarty.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.93,1:26:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什么莫里亚蒂?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Moriarty?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.89,1:26:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我一点也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've absolutely no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.76,1:26:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 走吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.42,1:26:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那当兵的 真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting, that soldier fellow.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.04,1:26:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他也许是我弟的救星...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be the making of my brother...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.94,1:27:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,或者让他更加不可救药\N{\fnArial\fs30}or make him worse than ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.58,1:27:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 还是提升他们的监视等级吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, we'd better upgrade their surveillance status.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.23,1:27:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,启动第三级监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grade three active.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.12,1:27:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官 谁的监视等级?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir... whose status?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.08,1:27:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯和华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson.